  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1)/(5√2-7)=a√2+b\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1)/(5√2-7)=a√2+b\n\nBy rationalizing;\n\n⇒ 1/(5√2 - 7) × (5√2 + 7)/(5√2 + 7) = a√2 + b \n\n⇒ (5√2 + 7)/((5√2)² - (7)²) = a√2 + b \n\n⇒ (5√2 + 7)/(50 - 49) = a√2 + b \n\n⇒ (5√2 + 7)/1 = a√2 + b \n\n⇒ (5√2 + 7) = a√2 + b \n\nBy comparing LHS and RHS;\n\n**∴ a = 5, b = 7**\n\n54:T6a5,",
